cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "sebal-et-gee: SEBAL-style daily evapotranspiration from Landsat 8/9 and ERA5-Land on Google Earth Engine"
abstract: >-
  A modular, open-source implementation of the SEBAL/METRIC surface-energy-balance
  method for daily actual evapotranspiration on Google Earth Engine. It combines
  Landsat 8/9 thermal and optical imagery with ERA5-Land forcing, and implements
  Tasumi (2008) broadband albedo, Bastiaanssen (1998) soil heat flux and the full
  CIMEC iterative sensible-heat solution with Monin-Obukhov stability correction.
  Developed and validated for the Thrace region of Türkiye against eight
  agrometeorological stations.
